[[1,63,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the Lambda sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890630\">K40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Using a suitable spanner (2a), USAG 875 or with similar characteristics,\nundo the lambda probe (2b) and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2033994.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Tighten the lambda probe to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Lambda probe</p></td><td><p>CONVERTER FRONT LAMDBA SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M8 x 1.5</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the lambda probe electrical connector.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Lambda sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890630\">K40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]